    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46618" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭpĕr-addo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>,
				dĭtum, 3, v. a., <i>to add over and above</i>, <i>to
				superadd</i> (<b>poet.</b>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">now usu. written separately): tumulo
					superaddite carmen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					E. 5, 42</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laurus superaddita busto,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop. 2, 13, 33</span></i>
			 (3, 5, 17): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					E. 3, 38</span></i>
			.</div>
